$DATUM 1,1,2-Trichloro-1,2-dimethyl-2-[2'-(9"-borabicyclo[3.3.1]nonyl)-ethyl]disilane
(1a): 9.2 ml (4.6 mmol) of 9-BBN (0.5M solution in thf) was added to 1 g
(4.55 mmol) of 1. 9-borabicyclo[3.3.1]nonane or BH3*thf was added slowly
to a stirred solution of the disilane at room temperature. After 4 h the
volatile components of the solution were removed under vacuum. Yield: 1.5
g, 96.7%. 29Si-NMR: δSi= 26.3, 17.8 ppm. 11B-NMR: δB= 84.3 ppm. 13C-NMR:
δC(ppm) = -1.1, 6.5 (Si-CH3), 10.1 (alkyl-bridge). GCMS: 342 (M+), 227
(SiMeCl(CH2CH2-9-BBN)), 155 (Si2Me2Cl2), 122 (9-BBN), 111 (C8H15), 82
(SiMe(CH2CH2B), 67(Si(CH2CH2B)).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
