$DATUM 1,2-Dimethyl-1,1,2,2-tetrakis[2'-(9"-borabicyclo-[3.3.1]nonyl)-ethyl]disilane
(4a): 41.1 mL (20.55 mmol) of 9-BBN (0.5 M solution in thf) was mixed
with 1 g (5.14 mmol) of 4. 9-borabicyclo[3.3.1]nonane or BH3*thf was
added slowly to a stirred solution of the disilane at room temperature.
After 4 h the volatile components of the solution were removed under
vacuum. Yield: 3.3 g, 94.0%. 29Si-NMR: δSi= -9.9 ppm. 11B-NMR: δB= 80.4
ppm. 13C NMR: δC (ppm) = -5.3 (Si-CH3), 5.9 (alkyl-bridge).
